  `CrossoverInsertMutatorDY`, `CrossoverReplaceMutatorDY`, `SpliceMutatorDY`
  and `BytesLargeExpandMutator` (adapted from `CrossoverInsertMutator`,
  `CrossoverReplaceMutator`, `SpliceMutator` and `BytesExpandMutator`).
- `puffin/src/fuzzer/stages.rs`: `scheduled_mutate` (adapted from
  `ScheduledMutator::scheduled_mutate`).

